Hi,

John Walicki shared some interim results from the LF Linux
Desktop WG's in-progress 2007 Linux Client Survey at today's
teleconference.  See:

  https://www.linux-foundation.org/en/2007ClientSurveyResults

With over 10,000 English responses so far (and 8,000 in other
survey languages), the following question and result should be
interesting to Printing Summit and Open Printing WG people:

"16. What peripheral device support is required to meet your
organization's desktop/client needs? (Select all that apply)"

The #1 peripheral requirement?   PRINTER - 83%

Cheers,
